{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/c7176c300dca8b2db50dd39a9e2d1dce.avif?t=1752677822\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No Knock is an open-world theft simulation game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/cf1e1ace93e047e4795060ec73bc7ed6.avif?t=1752677822\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/90f55fe81eb7ecf3be3348eb8eebd121.poster.avif?t=1752677822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/90f55fe81eb7ecf3be3348eb8eebd121.webm?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/90f55fe81eb7ecf3be3348eb8eebd121.mp4?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Roam the open world and spot targets you can rob. Look for ways to make money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/99c6c87ca20227b1e6fc5d842b579776.avif?t=1752677822\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/42926e616a53701f407c543e1442d781.poster.avif?t=1752677822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/42926e616a53701f407c543e1442d781.webm?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/42926e616a53701f407c543e1442d781.mp4?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start out as a small-time local thief and build your own crew.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/a55ba83000aa3aae820b2fa5cf20af1b.avif?t=1752677822\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/96b09391e882a5970e76e4f3c9951e86.poster.avif?t=1752677822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/96b09391e882a5970e76e4f3c9951e86.webm?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/96b09391e882a5970e76e4f3c9951e86.mp4?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in shootouts with the police and never get caught. Fight against rival gangs. Assemble the ultimate team of burglars and get rich. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/1181bf0c97d7eba3d58254361d5b3c0e.avif?t=1752677822\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/843a82644be543b5e9c68212f42ab552.poster.avif?t=1752677822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/843a82644be543b5e9c68212f42ab552.webm?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/843a82644be543b5e9c68212f42ab552.mp4?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel around using cars, motorcycles, skateboards, or bicycles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/b551b5ba389646b22b91ecde05c9ed5a.avif?t=1752677822\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/794b02526d01a0a1fc13cc94a69009ca.poster.avif?t=1752677822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/794b02526d01a0a1fc13cc94a69009ca.webm?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860450/extras/794b02526d01a0a1fc13cc94a69009ca.mp4?t=1752677822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire new properties to store your stolen goods, then sell them at the pawn shop \u2014 or find online buyers willing to pay even more. Beyond burglary, take on contract jobs as a hitman to eliminate special targets. Complete assigned missions and upgrade your tools to perform professional-level heists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character and equip the best gear. Body armor and firearms will give you a serious edge.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiply your earnings by gambling on slot machines or blackjack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your criminal business to the next level with the right strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>A thief is only a poet with quick hands.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860450?t=1752677822","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860450?t=1752677822","capsule_image":"h